    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8886" root="حلق" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأْسٌ حَلِيقٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْلُوقٌ</span></b>  [<i>A shaven head</i>]:
(ISd, TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعَرٌ حَلِيقٌ</span> [<i>hair shaven off</i>]:
(AZ, S:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِحْيَةٌ حَلِيقٌ</span> [<i>a beard shaven off</i>];
not <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلِيقَةٌ</span>: (AZ, S, K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْزٌ مَحْلُوقَةٌ</span></b>  [<i>a
shorn she-goat</i>]. (AZ, S.) The pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلِيقٌ</span> is
[<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْقِى</span> and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِلَاقٌ</span>. (TA.)

